<title>FRANCE: Gaumont 1996 turnover up 4.45 percent.</title>
<headline>Gaumont 1996 turnover up 4.45 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs) Full-year turnover	 1,290   vs  1,235.8</p>
<p>Fourth quarter turnover    485.4 vs    458.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Gaumont, a film theatre company, gave the figures in the BALO bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
